013.jpg Photorealistic portrait of Tifa Lockhart from Final Fantasy VII, beautiful East Asian woman with fair skin, delicate facial features, large expressive brown eyes, soft pink lips, long straight black hair styled in a high dolphin-tail ponytail with neat bangs framing her face, athletic yet highly curvaceous figure with full breasts, narrow waist and long milked legs, natural soft lighting, highly detailed skin texture, elegant and confident expression, clean simple background, focus only on her face, hair and body proportions. A realistic, 3D-style cinematic portrait of a beautiful young woman with long black hair styled in a classic dolphin tail. She is wearing a plain teal ribbed crop top with eracted nipples, a simple suspender design, and a very short white pleated miniskirt with leg exposed under it. No combat gear, no gloves, no armor, no materia. She is standing naturally in a warm, softly lit cozy environment with a confident, gentle expression. High quality, photorealistic, 8k resolution."raw photo, 3d aesthetic, high detail".
