025.jpg A mixed media digital composition combining a high-fidelity 3D rendered character scene with a graphic design infographic overlay, presenting an equipment analysis report for a female video game character resembling Tifa Lockhart from Final Fantasy VII. The central figure stands in a three-quarter pose facing forward, featuring fair skin with subsurface scattering, delicate facial features, and long black hair tied in a high ponytail with a long tail known as a dolphin tail. She is dressed in a white ribbed crop top with black trim and a small logo, supported by black Y-back suspenders, and a black leather pleated miniskirt secured with a tactical utility belt. Her right hand wears a red and black combat glove, while her left arm is a mechanical prosthetic, colored red and dark grey with a glowing green sphere (materia) embedded near the wrist, showing metallic and worn textures. She wears small teardrop earrings. The background is a warm, dimly lit interior space resembling a bar or workshop, featuring wooden flooring, dark wooden shelves with bottles, and wooden crates labeled "MIDGAR" in the lower corners, illuminated by a warm overhead pendant light. The 3D rendering utilizes realistic material properties, detailed fabric weave on the top, leather grain on the skirt, and a shallow depth of field that blurs the background environment into soft bokeh. Overlaid on this CGI scene are white rectangular text boxes containing black Chinese and English text in a clean sans-serif font, connected to the character by thin red leader lines with circular endpoints. The top right box is titled "??????" (Equipment Analysis Report) and lists "CLASSIC COMBAT GEAR" components including White Ribbed Top, Y-Back Suspenders, Combat Skirt, Red Gloves, and Materia. Other labels identify the hairstyle, earring, ribbed crop top (noting a text error where English reads "teardrop earring"), combat gloves, pleated miniskirt, an elbow guard for the mechanical arm, and the green materia. The composition balances the photorealistic 3D aesthetic of the character with the clean, flat vector style of the infographic elements, using a color palette of warm browns, skin tones, white, black, and accents of red and green, rendered in 8K ultra-detailed quality.這是一幅混合媒體數位作品,結合了高保真3D渲染的角色場景和圖形設計資訊圖,呈現了一份針對一位酷似《最終幻想VII》中蒂法·洛克哈特的女性遊戲角色的裝備分析報告。畫面中心人物以四分之三側面的姿勢面向前方,膚色白皙,帶有細微的表面散射效果,五官精緻,一頭烏黑長髮高高束成馬尾,髮尾呈海豚尾狀。她穿著白色羅紋露臍上衣,飾有黑色滾邊和小型標誌,由黑色Y型背帶支撐,下身是黑色皮革百褶迷你裙,腰間繫著戰術腰帶。她的右手戴著紅黑相間的戰鬥手套,左臂是紅色和深灰色相間的機械義肢,手腕附近鑲嵌著一顆發光的綠色球體（魔晶石）,呈現出金屬質感和磨損痕跡。她戴著小巧的淚滴形耳環。背景是一個溫暖昏暗的室內空間,類似酒吧或工作室,鋪著木地板,深色木架上擺放著酒瓶,角落裡放著標有“米德加爾”字樣的木箱,上方懸掛著一盞暖色調的吊燈。 3D渲染採用了逼真的材質屬性,上衣的織物紋理細緻入微,裙子的皮革紋理清晰可見,淺景深使背景環境呈現出柔和的散景效果。在這個CGI場景上疊加了白色的矩形文本框,其中包含黑色無襯線字體的中英文文本,文本之間以帶有圓形端點的細紅色引導線連接。右上角的文字框標題為“裝備分析報告”,列出了“經典戰鬥裝備”的組件,包括白色羅紋上衣、Y型背帶、戰鬥裙、紅色手套和魔晶石。其他標籤則標示了髮型、耳環、羅紋露臍上衣（指出英文原文有誤,寫成了「淚滴形耳環」）、戰鬥手套、百褶迷你裙、機械手臂的護肘以及綠色魔晶石。畫面構圖巧妙地平衡了角色逼真的3D美感與簡潔扁平的向量訊息元素風格,以暖棕色、膚色、白色、黑色為主色調,並以紅色和綠色點綴,最終以8K超高清分辨率呈現。
